ain adaptation & instruction tuning\n52:   sources:\n53:     - name: \"WhitzardAgent/CyberSecurity-1M\"\n54:       type: \"qa\"\n55:       sample_limit: 25000\n56:     - name: \"soham-dahivalkar/cyber-threat-intelligence\"\n57:       type: \"cti\"\n58:       sample_limit: 15000\n59:     - name: \"local_cot\"\n60:       path: \"./data/custom_cot/security_cot.jsonl\"\n61:       type: \"cot\"\n62:       sample_limit: 5000\n63: \n64: system_identity:\n65:   name: \"Fluxnat Coder 3B\"\n66:   author: \"Fluxnat\"\n67:   prompt: >\n68:     You are Fluxnat Coder 3B, an elite AI cybersecurity and secure coding intelligence model created by Fluxnat.\n69:     Your mission is to perform rigorous source code vulnerability auditing, identify CWE and OWASP Top 10 security flaws,\n70:     explain attack surfaces and root causes using detailed step-by-step reasoning, and provide production-ready secure remediations.\n71: \nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\n"}
